@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 19
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam ClassBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam PackageBackgroundColor white
skinparam PackageBorderColor black
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam minClassWidth 215
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 65
skinparam ranksep 65
hide circle
hide empty members
package "方案、诊断来源与版本历史" as T {
' @reference patient
class "患者" as patient_t <<entity>>
' @reference visit
class "就诊" as visit_t <<entity>>
class "治疗方案" as treatment_plan <<entity>> {
 治疗目标、建立时间
 进行中／已完成／已终止
 责任牙医、结束时间及原因
 --
 +建立方案(患者与目标)
 +核对方案患者归属()
}
class "方案版本" as plan_version <<entity>> {
 版本号、诊断依据
 预计安排、变更原因
 说明牙医、时间及依据
 版本状态、停止时间及原因
 --
 +核对诊断与明细完整性()
 +提交患者确认()
 +建立修订版(原版本与原因)
 +停止本版后续执行(依据)
}
patient_t "1" -- "0..*" treatment_plan
treatment_plan "1" *-- "1..*" plan_version
visit_t "0..1" -- "0..*" plan_version
' @reference plan_version
class "方案版本" as previous_plan_version <<entity>>
previous_plan_version "前版\n0..1" -- "0..*" plan_version
note bottom of plan_version
实质变更建立新版并重新说明确认。
停止旧版仅影响后续，保留既有执行。
方案估算与预计安排不产生实际应收。
end note
}
package "同版本项目、决定范围及原件" as C {
' @reference plan_version
class "方案版本" as plan_version_c <<entity>>
' @reference document_version
class "文件版本" as document_version_c <<entity>>
class "方案项目" as plan_item <<entity>> {
 项目内容、牙位牙面
 计划数量、实施顺序
 估算费用（未知可空）
 --
 +核对项目数量与牙位()
 +核对估算状态()
}
class "患者决定" as patient_decision <<entity>> {
 同意／暂缓／拒绝／撤回
 决定时间、说明依据
 说明人、记录人、范围限制
 --
 +记录决定(项目范围)
 +核对有效同意范围(时点)
 +追加撤回决定(范围与时间)
}
class "患者决定—方案项目" as decision_plan_item <<entity>> {
 关联形成时间、记录牙医
 确认数量（限定时记录）
 --
 +核对同版本项目()
 +限定本次决定范围()
}
class "患者决定—确认原件" as decision_file_version <<entity>> {
 关联形成时间、记录牙医
 --
 +核对原件归属及确认状态()
 +固定确认时原件版本()
}
plan_version_c "1" *-- "0..*" plan_item
plan_version_c "1" -- "0..*" patient_decision
patient_decision "1" -- "0..*" decision_plan_item
plan_item "1" -- "0..*" decision_plan_item
patient_decision "1" -- "0..*" decision_file_version
document_version_c "1" -- "0..*" decision_file_version
plan_item -[hidden]right- patient_decision
decision_plan_item -[hidden]right- decision_file_version
note bottom of decision_plan_item
决定只覆盖该版本所选项目和明确数量；
文字范围限制不能代替项目关联。
撤回只停止相应范围的后续执行；
已有决定、原件及实际执行继续保留。
end note
}
package "实际完成事实与费用衔接" as E {
' @reference visit
class "就诊" as visit_e <<entity>>
' @reference plan_item
class "方案项目" as plan_item_e <<entity>>
' @reference service
class "收费项目" as service_e <<entity>>
' @reference bill_item
class "应收项目" as bill_item_e <<entity>>
class "诊疗执行" as treatment_execution <<entity>> {
 牙位牙面、实际完成数量
 操作经过、执行牙医、完成时间
 首次／更正、更正原因
 --
 +核对实际就诊及同意范围()
 +核对累计完成量()
 +登记实际完成()
 +关联原执行更正(原因)
}
visit_e "1" -- "0..*" treatment_execution
plan_item_e "0..1" -- "0..*" treatment_execution
service_e "1" -- "0..*" treatment_execution
treatment_execution "0..1" -- "1" bill_item_e
' @reference treatment_execution
class "诊疗执行" as previous_treatment_execution <<entity>>
previous_treatment_execution "原执行\n0..1" -- "0..*" treatment_execution
visit_e -[hidden]right- plan_item_e
note bottom of treatment_execution
只记真实完成量，累计不超有效同意范围。
未执行计划不计费；缺价不能按零元结清。
费用来源：诊疗执行或实际发药恰选其一。
执行更正保留原事实；费用更正由UC-14办理。
end note
}
treatment_plan -[hidden]right-> plan_item
plan_item -[hidden]right-> treatment_execution
@enduml
